-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This MIT license covers **the source code and the documents authored in this
repository only**.

It does NOT cover any third-party dataset. No third-party dataset is
redistributed here: `data/external/` is deliberately absent and `.gitignore`d.
Every dataset used by this project keeps its own license, is listed with its
provenance in `data_registry/PROVENANCE_LEDGER.csv`, and must be obtained from
its official source by the user. See `docs/DATA_ACCESS.md`.

Files under `results/tables/` are derived numeric outputs of this project's own
code and are covered by the MIT license above.
